# Harta: Ascent (Attacker side)

MAPBG data/images/ascent_spawn.png
START spawn

NODE spawn start "Attacker spawn on Ascent. You need to attack a site and plant. Where does the team push?"
BG spawn data/images/ascent_spawn.png
CHOICE spawn a "Push A site through main" a_main
CHOICE spawn b "Fast rush B through market" b_rush
CHOICE spawn m "Contest mid control first" mid_control ROTATE

NODE a_main start "You head toward A main. Halfway through, Jett gets picked off by an Operator lurking in A lobby."
BG a_main data/images/ascent_a.png
CHOICE a_main p "Push through the gap - rush site" a_rush
CHOICE a_main r "Fall back and rotate to B" b_from_mid TEAM_IGNORED

NODE a_rush spike_dropped "You push through A main. The spike carrier goes in front and gets taken out by an operator. Spike dropped in enemy territory."
BG a_rush data/images/ascent_a.png
CHOICE a_rush g "Grab the spike yourself and entry" a_plant SPIKE_DROPPED
CHOICE a_rush s "Wait for team to smoke and entry." a_smoke

NODE a_plant win "You grab the spike mid-fight, dodge two bullets, and plant it on A default. Flawless under pressure."
BG a_plant data/images/ascent_a.png
TERMINAL a_plant win

NODE a_smoke start "Omen smokes off both defender angles. The team walks in unchallenged and plants comfortably."
BG a_smoke data/images/ascent_a.png
CHOICE a_smoke w "Hold the plant - wait for defuse attempt" a_win
CHOICE a_smoke r "One person rotates mid to watch flank" mid_rotate

NODE a_win win "Defenders try to push through smoke to defuse but get cleaned up. Round won on A site."
BG a_win data/images/ascent_a.png
TERMINAL a_win win

NODE b_rush start "Full B rush. Your team charges through market. A Sage wall goes up from the defenders - team split!"
BG b_rush data/images/ascent_b.png
CHOICE b_rush j "Jett dashes over the wall" b_over
CHOICE b_rush w "Wait for the wall to break" b_wait TEAM_IGNORED
CHOICE b_rush m "Two hold market, rest rotate mid" mid_split ROTATE

NODE b_over spike_dropped "Jett dashes over the Sage wall but she is 1v2 on site. She gets traded and drops the spike."
BG b_over data/images/ascent_b.png
CHOICE b_over r "Rush in to pick up the spike" b_plant SPIKE_DROPPED
CHOICE b_over f "Hold outside - wait for wall to break" b_wait

NODE b_plant win "You push through the Sage wall, pick up the spike, and plant it in B default. Defenders are spread thin."
BG b_plant data/images/ascent_b.png
TERMINAL b_plant win

NODE b_wait team_ignored "Half the team waits outside market while 2 defenders reinforce B site. You are outnumbered."
BG b_wait data/images/ascent_b.png
CHOICE b_wait c "Commit anyway - all-in B" b_commit
CHOICE b_wait r "Rotate mid - try to take A" mid_rotate

NODE b_commit lose "The push is disorganized. Three players trade for nothing. Defenders retake. Round lost."
BG b_commit data/images/ascent_b.png
TERMINAL b_commit lose

NODE mid_split start "Your team splits: 2 go B market, 3 contest mid. Mid is secured - B link is now open."
BG mid_split data/images/ascent_mid.png
CHOICE mid_split b "Full execute B through link" b_plant
CHOICE mid_split a "Rotate A with mid advantage" a_smoke

NODE mid_control rotate "You take mid control. Sova dart reveals 2 defenders rotating from B to A. Perfect info."
BG mid_control data/images/ascent_mid.png
CHOICE mid_control a "Hit A while defenders are rotating" a_smoke
CHOICE mid_control b "Hit B while it is undermanned" b_plant
CHOICE mid_control s "Hold mid and split defenders further" mid_hold

NODE mid_hold start "You hold mid and deny rotations. Defenders are confused and hold their sites."
BG mid_hold data/images/ascent_mid.png
CHOICE mid_hold a "Break toward A through mid" a_win
CHOICE mid_hold b "Break toward B through mid" b_plant

NODE mid_rotate rotate "You rotate through mid with 3 players. A site has only 1 defender. Clean execute incoming."
BG mid_rotate data/images/ascent_mid.png
CHOICE mid_rotate a "Full A execute - 3v1" a_win
CHOICE mid_rotate s "Set up post-plant smokes from mid" a_win

NODE b_from_mid team_ignored "You try to rotate to B through mid but 2 teammates push A anyway. Complete chaos."
BG b_from_mid data/images/ascent_mid.png
CHOICE b_from_mid f "Follow teammates to A - commit" a_rush
CHOICE b_from_mid b "Solo rush B - take the 1v1" b_solo TEAM_IGNORED

NODE b_solo lose "You hit B alone. The site has 2 defenders. No support comes. Round over."
BG b_solo data/images/ascent_b.png
TERMINAL b_solo lose
